msgstr "फाइलसिसटम ब्राउजर"

#: katefileselector.cpp:74
msgid "Browse through the filesystem"
msgstr "फाइलसिसटम मं ब्राउज करव"

#: katefileselector.cpp:127
msgid "File Selector"
msgstr "फाइल चुनइया"

#: katefileselector.cpp:133
msgid "File Selector Settings"
msgstr "फाइल चुनइया सेटिंग"

#: katefileselector.cpp:194
msgid "Bookmarks"
msgstr " निसानी "

#: katefileselector.cpp:216
msgid "Current Document Folder"
msgstr "अभी हाल के कागद फोल्डर"

#: katefileselector.cpp:243
msgid ""
"<p>Here you can enter a path for a folder to display.</p><p>To go to a "
"folder previously entered, press the arrow on the right and choose one.</"
"p><p>The entry has folder completion. Right-click to choose how completion "
"should behave.</p>"
msgstr ""

#: katefileselector.cpp:247
msgid ""
"<p>Here you can enter a name filter to limit which files are displayed.</"
"p><p>To clear the filter, toggle off the filter button to the left.</p><p>To "
"reapply the last filter used, toggle on the filter button.</p>"
msgstr ""

#: katefileselector.cpp:250
msgid ""
"<p>This button clears the name filter when toggled off, or reapplies the "
"last filter used when toggled on.</p>"
msgstr ""
"<p>जब टागल बन्द होथे  तहां ए बटन नाम छनइया ल साफ करथे , या आखरी छनइया "
"को फिर से लागू करथे  जब टागल चालू होथे .</p>"

#: katefileselector.cpp:394
#, kde-format
msgid "Apply last filter (\"%1\")"
msgstr "आखरी छनइया लगाव (\"%1\")"

#: katefileselector.cpp:400
msgid "Clear filter"
msgstr "फिल्टर साफ करव"

#: katefileselector.cpp:658
msgid "Toolbar"
msgstr "औजार पट्टी"

#: katefileselector.cpp:660
msgid "A&vailable actions:"
msgstr "मिलत काम: (&v)"

#: katefileselector.cpp:661
msgid "S&elected actions:"
msgstr "चुनी गे काम: (&e)"

#: katefileselector.cpp:674
msgid "Auto Synchronization"
msgstr "अपने अपन सिंक्रोनाइजेसन"

#: katefileselector.cpp:675
msgid "When a docu&ment becomes active"
msgstr "जब कागद सक्रिय हो जाय (&m)"

#: katefileselector.cpp:676
msgid "When the file selector becomes visible"
msgstr "जब फाइल चयनग दिखने जइसन हो"

#: katefileselector.cpp:689
msgid "Remember &locations:"
msgstr "जगह याद रखव: (&l)"

#: katefileselector.cpp:696
msgid "Remember &filters:"
msgstr "फिल्टर याद रखव: (&f)"

#: katefileselector.cpp:703
msgid "Session"
msgstr "सत्र"

#: katefileselector.cpp:704
msgid "Restore loca&tion"
msgstr "जगह बहाल करव (&t)"

#: katefileselector.cpp:705
msgid "Restore last f&ilter"
msgstr "आखरी छनइया बहाल करव (&i)"

#: katefileselector.cpp:731
msgid ""
"<p>Decides how many locations to keep in the history of the location combo "
"box.</p>"
msgstr "<p>लोकेसन काम्बो डब्बा के इतिहास मं कतका जगह रखना हे ए निस्चित करथे .</p>"

#: katefileselector.cpp:736
msgid ""
"<p>Decides how many filters to keep in the history of the filter combo box.</"
"p>"
msgstr "<p>फिल्टर काम्बो डब्बा के इतिहास मं कतका छनइया रखना हे ए निस्चित करथे .</p>"

#: katefileselector.cpp:741
msgid ""
"<p>These options allow you to have the File Selector automatically change "
"location to the folder of the active document on certain events.</p><p>Auto "
"synchronization is <em>lazy</em>, meaning it will not take effect until the "
"file selector is visible.</p><p>None of these are enabled by default, but "
"you can always sync the location by pressing the sync button in the toolbar."
"</p>"
msgstr ""

#: katefileselector.cpp:750
msgid ""
"<p>If this option is enabled (default), the location will be restored when "
"you start Kate.</p><p><strong>Note</strong> that if the session is handled "
"by the KDE session manager, the location is always restored.</p>"
msgstr ""

#: katefileselector.cpp:754
msgid ""
"<p>If this option is enabled (default), the current filter will be restored "
"when you start Kate.<p><strong>Note</strong> that if the session is handled "
"by the KDE session manager, the filter is always restored.</"
"p><p><strong>Note</strong> that some of the autosync settings may override "
"the restored location if on.</p>"
msgstr ""

